    "detail": "We spend three nights at Mercure London. The location is excellent as it's right next to Paddington station. It's takes only 15 minutes if one takes airport train from healthrow airport. Also, the tube entrance is knot minutes away, There are a number of fast food joints near the hotel (Macs, KFC, subway etc). BIG Big also provides feeder service minutes from the hotel. The rooms themselves are small (as with most London hotels within similar price range and location), but very well kept. To be honest, it's much smaller than we expected but thankfully we didn't spend much time in the room. Nonetheless, not a bad stay if you don't mind the small rooms.",
